-- Expand the existing Ways to Earn section with remote-work categories and detailed descriptions.
UPDATE sections
SET title='Explore online work and ways to earn',
    eyebrow='FLEXIBLE ONLINE OPPORTUNITIES',
    body='Explore flexible online activities. Actual availability, eligibility, task instructions and rewards are shown in the member area and may vary.\\nWatch Videos|Explore TikTok and YouTube video activities.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Watch short videos and follow the activity instructions shown in your LipaHub member area. Each task may have its own eligibility rules, viewing requirements and reward details.|\\nClick Ads|Discover advertising and promotional engagement tasks.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Browse available promotional placements and complete the actions described on each task. Always review the task rules before participating.|\\nWrite Blogs|Create written content through blogging activities.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Write useful, original blog content based on the topic and guidelines provided. Tasks may specify word counts, formatting, originality and submission requirements.|\\nAnswer Surveys|Share your opinions through online surveys.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553877522-43269d4ea984?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Take part in research questionnaires and share honest answers. Survey availability can depend on your location and eligibility, and not every survey will accept every participant.|\\nPlay Games|Take part in eligible game-based activities.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Explore game-related tasks and follow the stated completion steps. Check any time limits, account requirements and proof-of-completion rules before starting.|\\nSpin to Win|Explore spin activities and review their rules.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606167668584-78701c57f13d?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Join available spin promotions where offered. Read the terms, eligibility conditions and any limits carefully; prizes or rewards are not guaranteed.|\\nLearn Forex|Access Forex learning and educational activities.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Build your understanding of currency markets through beginner-friendly learning materials and practice activities. Educational content is not financial advice and trading involves risk.|\\nRefer Friends|Invite friends using the LipaHub referral programme.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737711867-e3b97375f902?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Share your referral link with people who may be interested in LipaHub. Referral eligibility, qualification steps and any rewards are subject to the programme terms.|\\nVirtual Assistant|Support businesses with remote admin tasks.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-b413da4baf72?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Help with scheduling, inbox organisation, document preparation, data updates and other routine remote support tasks. Each assignment should include its own scope and expected turnaround.|\\nData Entry|Organise information and update digital records.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Enter, format and check information in spreadsheets, forms or online systems. Accuracy, confidentiality and following instructions are important.|\\nTranscription|Turn audio recordings into written text.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590602847861-f357a9332bbc?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Listen to audio and produce clear written transcripts. Tasks may include speaker labels, timestamps or formatting requirements, and good listening skills are useful.|\\nProofreading|Review writing for clarity, spelling and grammar.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Review documents and articles for spelling, punctuation, grammar and readability. Follow the style guide and preserve the author intended meaning.|\\nGraphic Design|Create visual content for digital channels.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545235617-9465d2a55698?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Create social graphics, banners, simple layouts or other visual assets using the brief and supplied brand guidelines.|\\nSocial Media Support|Help manage posts and online communities.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Assist with scheduling posts, preparing captions, responding to routine comments and organising content calendars for social channels.|\\nCustomer Support|Help customers through chat and email.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551836022-d5d88e9218df?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Respond to common questions, organise support requests and provide polite assistance through approved chat or email channels. Follow privacy and escalation guidelines.|\\nWeb Research|Find and organise useful information online.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1456324504439-367cee3b3c32?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Research topics using reliable sources, collect relevant details and present findings clearly in the requested format.|\\nOnline Tutoring|Share knowledge through remote learning support.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503676260728-1c00da094a0b?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Support learners in subjects you understand well. Tutoring tasks may require preparation, clear explanations and agreed session times.|\\nTranslation|Translate short content between languages you know.|https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?w=900&q=85&fit=crop|Translate text while preserving its meaning, tone and context. Only accept language pairs you can handle confidently and review the task requirements.|',
    item_limit=24,
    enabled=1
WHERE type='earning_grid'
ORDER BY id
LIMIT 1;
